# JS-First Fixes

`build-sections.js` generates `sections/*.html` from `window.SECTIONS` defined in `js/sections-data.js`. Direct edits to generated HTML will be overwritten on the next build.

**Always make fixes and content changes in the JS source files** (e.g. `js/sections-data.js`, `js/projects.js`) rather than in `sections/*.html`.
